  <main id="main" class="compressor-page">
    <section class="compressor-hero"><div class="container-page compressor-hero-grid"><div class="compressor-hero-copy"><nav class="compressor-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="index.html">Home</a><span>/</span><a href="products.html">Products</a><span>/</span><span aria-current="page">Compressors</span></nav><span class="eyebrow">Refrigeration Equipment</span><h1>Compressors matched to the demands of your system.</h1><p>Explore dependable compressor families for industrial, commercial, transport and low-temperature refrigeration applications—selected with practical engineering support.</p><div class="compressor-hero-actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="contact.html">Request a Quote <i data-lucide="arrow-up-right" class="h-4 w-4"></i></a><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#compressor-ranges">Explore Compressor Ranges</a></div><div class="compressor-quickfacts"><span><i data-lucide="factory"></i>Industrial & commercial</span><span><i data-lucide="snowflake"></i>Low-temperature capable</span><span><i data-lucide="wrench"></i>Selection support</span></div></div><div class="compressor-hero-image"><img src="assets/images/compressors/bock-semi-hermetic.jpg" alt="BOCK semi-hermetic refrigeration compressor"><div><span>Featured range</span><b>BOCK semi-hermetic compressors</b></div></div></div></section>
    <section class="compressor-intro section-pad"><div class="container-page compressor-intro-grid"><div><span class="eyebrow">The Right Starting Point</span><h2>One product category. Multiple proven technologies.</h2></div><p>Compressor selection affects efficiency, temperature capability, footprint and long-term serviceability. Our range brings together established manufacturers and technologies so each project can be matched to its actual operating conditions.</p></div></section>
    <section id="compressor-ranges" class="compressor-ranges section-pad"><div class="container-page"><div class="compressor-section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">Our Compressor Range</span><h2>Four specialist brands. A broader choice of performance.</h2></div><p>Talk to our engineering team to identify the right family and configuration for your system.</p></div><div class="compressor-brand-grid"><article class="compressor-brand-card"><div class="compressor-brand-image"><img src="assets/images/compressors/bock-semi-hermetic.jpg" alt="BOCK semi-hermetic compressor"></div><div class="compressor-brand-copy"><span>BOCK</span><h3>Semi-hermetic, open & condensing units</h3><p>Air-cooled and gas-cooled compressor options, including single- and two-stage condensing units for demanding refrigeration applications.</p><ul><li>SHA, SHG and SHGZ condensing-unit series</li><li>Low-temperature and shock-freezing applications</li></ul></div></article><article class="compressor-brand-card"><div class="compressor-brand-image"><img src="assets/images/compressors/mycom-screw.jpg" alt="MYCOM screw compressor"></div><div class="compressor-brand-copy"><span>MYCOM</span><h3>Reciprocating & screw compressors</h3><p>Industrial compressor choices across reciprocating and two-stage screw configurations for projects that need robust refrigeration capacity.</p><ul><li>M II and WBHE reciprocating series</li><li>Small-size and compound two-stage screw series</li></ul></div></article><article class="compressor-brand-card"><div class="compressor-brand-image"><img src="assets/images/compressors/copeland-scroll.jpg" alt="Copeland Scroll transport compressor"></div><div class="compressor-brand-copy"><span>COPELAND</span><h3>Horizontal variable-speed scroll</h3><p>The ZRHVKTE transport compressor family is designed for compact rail applications where smooth operation and dependable performance matter.</p><ul><li>R134A and R407C refrigerants</li><li>4-14 HP capacity range</li></ul></div></article><article class="compressor-brand-card"><div class="compressor-brand-image"><img src="assets/images/compressors/tecumseh-aw.jpg" alt="Tecumseh AW commercial compressor family"></div><div class="compressor-brand-copy"><span>TECUMSEH</span><h3>AW family for commercial cooling</h3><p>Efficient, robust compressor options developed for commercial refrigeration and a broad range of cooling capacities.</p><ul><li>Available as compressor and condensing-unit options</li><li>For cold rooms, counters, ice cream machines and more</li></ul></div></article></div></div></section>
    <section class="compressor-selection"><div class="container-page compressor-selection-grid"><div class="compressor-selection-visual"><img src="assets/images/compressors/tecumseh-aw.jpg" alt="Commercial refrigeration compressor"><div><i data-lucide="settings-2"></i><span>Selection based on your operating requirements</span></div></div><div class="compressor-selection-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Engineering-Led Selection</span><h2>Choose with system context, not catalog pages alone.</h2><p>Our engineers consider your cooling application, operating temperature, refrigerant, capacity, installation space and service requirements before recommending a suitable compressor path.</p><div class="selection-list"><div><i data-lucide="thermometer-snowflake"></i><span>Temperature range and refrigeration duty</span></div><div><i data-lucide="gauge"></i><span>Capacity and energy requirements</span></div><div><i data-lucide="ruler"></i><span>Available space and system configuration</span></div></div><a class="text-link-dark" href="contact.html">Speak with an engineer <i data-lucide="arrow-up-right"></i></a></div></div></section>
    <section class="compressor-cta"><div class="container-page compressor-cta-inner"><div><span class="eyebrow">Start Your Selection</span><h2>Need the right compressor for a new or existing system?</h2><p>Share your requirement and our team will help you identify a practical equipment route.</p></div><a class="btn btn-primary" href="contact.html">Talk to Thermo-Care <i data-lucide="arrow-up-right" class="h-4 w-4"></i></a></div></section>
